      "en": "Saul summoned the people, and counted them in Telaim, two hundred thousand footmen and ten thousand men of Judah.",
      "ko": "사울이 백성을 소집하고 그들을 들라임에서 계수하니 보병이 이십만이요 유다 사람이 일만이라",
      "source_text_hash": "73bac64f855b19011d5607870ff45f9192d83e9c73825dd75b910792334fbf7d",
      "translation_text_hash": "59a6656b21d41c54873919741c9d11ab7655fae723b80a568c099cd764af00e8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
