      ],
      "en": "Why then didn’t you obey the LORD’s voice, but took the plunder, and did that which was evil in the LORD’s sight?”",
      "ko": "어찌하여 왕이 여호와의 목소리를 청종치 아니하고 탈취하기에만 급하여 여호와의 악하게 여기시는 것을 행하였나이까",
      "source_text_hash": "e6a47579a630b23bfb17b7ffa87c3389e1e896d0aa1f2b1010f50b4f08dd0f9a",
      "translation_text_hash": "f78f48c52df973353ee086081ba57d9039852b53106f4723cdaea30abb66bda7",
