      "en": "Samuel said to him, “The LORD has torn the kingdom of Israel from you today, and has given it to a neighbor of yours who is better than you.",
      "ko": "사무엘이 그에게 이르되 여호와께서 오늘 이스라엘 나라를 왕에게서 떼어서 왕보다 나은 왕의 이웃에게 주셨나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "cb7688cdc2df34cd6e41cf3c8b0d9513b52bba3ce61e9c1d90469b865cf8a8f4",
